{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:0e62277a1238c807","name":"Lava Flow","source":{"id":"source:reference-0e62277a1238c807","title":"Lava Flow","revision":21365,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T01:40:01Z","sha256":"d6202be6510995ccb43f1b395f2a255e62f9d98732bc44227b5bb54b4452836b","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21365","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Lava%20Flow&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-0e62277a1238c807","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unknown Regions Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unknown_Regions_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["The dark orange glow and blistering heat of the lava are warnings that you should stay away."]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Virtually every planet in the galaxy has magma at its core, and lava can appear just about anywhere, including underground. A Lava Flow makes a good barrier. Placing a subterranean stronghold on an island surrounded by a lava moat challenges the heroes to find a different entrance. A bridge above a Lava Flow makes an exciting location for a battle as the heroes struggle to stay out of the searing magma while trying to defeat their enemies.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Lava Flow Statistics (CL 15)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Keywords:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fire","referenceId":"reference:c141faa80e43a119"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Natural"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Natural"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Trigger:"]}," A being begins its turn adjacent to a Lava Flow.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Attack:"]}," +17 vs ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," 2d6 (-2 steps on the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"},")\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Recurrence:"]}," Each round at the start of the target's turn, as long as the target remains adjacent to the Lava Flow.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Suggested ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skills"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skills","referenceId":"reference:66d0f523a379b2de"},":"]}," The following are suggested ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skills"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skills","referenceId":"reference:66d0f523a379b2de"}," for this Hazard:\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Acrobatics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Acrobatics","referenceId":"reference:0d0b7eee2953750e"}," (DC 27):"]}," The character tumbles away from the Lava Flow, gaining a +5 circumstance bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," against the Hazard."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Jump"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jump","referenceId":"reference:9ee0ca3e24d60ea0"}," (DC 27):"]}," The character jumps over or away from the Lava Flow, gaining a +2 circumstance bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," against the Hazard."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Knowledge (Physical Sciences)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knowledge_(Physical_Sciences)"}," (DC 22):"]}," The character can predict how the Lava Flow will move; the character and their allies gain a +1 circumstance bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," against the Hazard."]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Special:"]}," Any being or object touched by the lava catches ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fire","referenceId":"reference:c141faa80e43a119"}," and takes an additional 1d6 points of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fire","referenceId":"reference:c141faa80e43a119"}," damage each round until the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fire","referenceId":"reference:c141faa80e43a119"}," is extinguished.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
